      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"matches exactly the advertised percentage\" isn\u0027t accurate: cap \u003d max(1, floor(pct/100*fleet)), so it equals the % only when fleet*pct is a multiple of 100. It undershoots for most fleets (10 @25% -\u003e 2 \u003d 20%) and overshoots for tiny ones (3 @25% -\u003e 1 \u003d 33%). Suggest \"approximately the advertised percentage; rounded down to whole hosts but never below one for a non-zero percentage.\" (Also line 317/118: \"self-scheduleable\" -\u003e \"self-schedulable\".)",
